From c48dd4872d54694af3157020f120fe823c546b6d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 02:34:16 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Campus doctrines slice 3: the Teleport Sigil and portal
 strikes

- T1 Waygate: guild outposts, secured sites, claimed shard zones and held caches become waystones
- T2 Recall: detachments recalled from anywhere; a marching party can step home to the dock
- T3 doctrine: Gate Network (Allied settlements are waystones); Sally Port listed, blocked
- Portal strikes: hostile kingdoms learn the pattern, strike through the Sigil; home-city fight compiled around it; loss damages buildings and takes gold; seal to refuse
- Building repair for materials; damaged buildings mend before they upgrade
- Debug: force a portal strike; save asserts for the portal fields

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RF7HNp6pvyXiAz229q52Px
